      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that looks solid. i just want to make it feel a little less \"templatey\" if that makes sense. can you add a sentence or two that acknowledges how tough the decision was because of their specific background in cloud infrastructure? i want them to feel like we actually paid attention to their profile.",
